<title>USA: John Alden Financial Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>John Alden Financial Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.10	 loss     $0.72</p>
<p> Net loss	  2,400	 loss     18,800</p>
<p> Revs		351,400		  413,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  25,620		   25,866</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$1.15	 profit   $0.20</p>
<p> Net profit	29,600	profit   5,100</p>
<p> Revs		1,847,700		1,945,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  25,651		   25,721</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is John Alden Financial Corp.</p>
<p>Q4 loss from continuing operations was $0.57 per share, compared to a loss of $0.97 per share for the same period the year before.</p>
</text>
